[2025-07-23 23:04:18 INF] JobId=2863f22b-151b-4939-83f5-a3d6ef224f7b QnetTransform.LLMUtils.Interfaces.ILLMInvoker: Response JSON returned from API: {"response":"# Technical Summary of EF Core Project Migration to .NET 8\n\nThe code diff shows a migration of an Entity Framework Core project from .NET 6 to .NET 8, with reorganized namespaces and updated package references. The project structure has been modernized while maintaining the existing database modeling and query patterns.\n\n## Key Technical Changes:\n\n* **Framework Upgrade:**\n  * Upgraded from .NET 6.0 to .NET 8.0\n  * Updated all EF Core packages from version 6.0.0 to 8.0.8\n  * Updated Microsoft.Extensions packages to newer versions (8.0.0/9.0.2)\n\n* **Namespace Reorganization:**\n  * `EFCore.Data` → `EFCore.Data.Context` for ApplicationDbContext\n  * `EFCore.Data` → `EFCore.Data.Factory` for ApplicationDbContextFactory\n  * `EFCore.DataAccess` → `EFCore.DataAccess.Products` for ProductDbContext\n  * Renamed `Queries` class to `ProductQueries` for better semantics\n\n* **Package Management:**\n  * Removed legacy `packages.config` in favor of PackageReference format\n  * Added explicit reference to EntityFramework 6.5.1\n\n* **Project Configuration:**\n  * Simplified csproj format by removing redundant XML and reorganizing elements\n  * Maintained output configuration and implicit using settings\n\nThe database schema definition and entity relationships remain unchanged throughout the migration."}.
